# Raised drain grates in the first lane off the platform wall, rows of three: at the deep end in the gap between
# the lap lines' T bars and the first cross line's vent, touching neither (from the deck video), and between cross
# lines 2-3 and 3-4 (measured in the pool videos).
- {id: grates_1, type: mesh, asset: raised_grates, center_m: [2.915, 1.865]}
- {id: grates_2, type: mesh, asset: raised_grates, center_m: [9.455, 1.865]}
